  "description": "Deterministic action firewall for AI agents on .NET. Intercepts tool calls before they execute and evaluates them against a permission envelope: incident-derived rules for destructive SQL, shell and git destruction, cloud teardown, credential egress and mass sends, plus per-run and per-agent call/token ceilings and runaway-loop detection. Observe mode is the default and blocks nothing, so the first run reports what enforce mode would have stopped. No ML on the decision path, no outbound network calls, verdicts in microseconds. Adapters ship separately as Invarix.Gate.Extensions.AI and Invarix.Gate.AgentFramework; MCP client tools are covered through the same interception point.",
